WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.263
Time to get a job onto the shop floor. Here's how releasing works.

00:00:05.213 --> 00:00:06.597
Open Production.

00:00:07.563 --> 00:00:11.048
Find your part at the bottom, and hit Create production order.

00:00:11.398 --> 00:00:14.651
Check the quantity, add a note for the team, and save.

00:00:15.673 --> 00:00:21.334
See that? Release is greyed out. The ERP tells you why: not enough material in stock.

00:00:21.684 --> 00:00:26.309
Good news, the steel just arrived. So over in Purchasing, hit Receive.

00:00:26.909 --> 00:00:30.292
Back in Production, Release is live. Click it.

00:00:31.109 --> 00:00:32.725
And the job is running.

00:00:34.209 --> 00:00:38.904
That's the release check. No approved drawing, no material, no start.

